22
# Node.js version for the portfolio's Cloudflare Pages build.
#
# The Pages project's root directory is web/ (DEPLOY.md section 2), so the
# build image reads THIS file, not the repo root's - the same reason vant
# mirrors its .npmrc into each Pages root.
#
# 22 is active LTS; the CF v3 build image defaults to 22.23.4, and vite 8
# + prestruct need ^20.19 || >=22.12. The version line stays FIRST: the
# family's CF Pages deploy (vant, pass 338) proved a comments-first .nvmrc
# is not something every builder parser survives - it installed an EOL
# node anyway and tripped npm EBADENGINE.
